  "item": [
    {
      "name": "JSON RPC - Standard Odoo API",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Authenticate (Login)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.result) {",
                  "        var uid = jsonData.result;",
                  "        if (uid && typeof uid === 'number' && uid > 0) {",
                  "            pm.environment.set('odoo_uid', uid.toString());",
                  "            console.log('Authentication successful. UID:', uid);",
                  "            pm.test('Authentication successful', function () {",
                  "                pm.expect(uid).to.be.a('number');",
                  "                pm.expect(uid).to.be.above(0);",
                  "            });",
                  "        } else {",
                  "            console.error('Authentication failed. Result:', uid);",
                  "            pm.test('Authentication failed', function () {",
                  "                pm.expect(uid).to.not.be.false;",
                  "            });",
                  "        }",
                  "    } else if (jsonData.error) {",
                  "        console.error('Authentication error:', jsonData.error.message);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n    \"method\": \"call\",\n    \"params\": {\n        \"service\": \"common\",\n        \"method\": \"authenticate\",\n        \"args\": [\n            \"{{odoo_database}}\",\n            \"{{odoo_username}}\",\n            \"{{odoo_password}}\",\n            {}\n        ]\n    },\n    \"id\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{odoo_base_url}}/jsonrpc",
              "host": [
                "{{odoo_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "jsonrpc"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate with Odoo using JSON RPC. This is the standard way to authenticate with Odoo API.\n\n**Important Notes:**\n- Verify that odoo_database, odoo_username, and odoo_password are correctly set in your environment variables\n- The authenticate method returns the user ID (uid) **directly as an integer**, not as an object\n- The test script automatically saves the UID to the environment variable 'odoo_uid'\n- If you get 'Access Denied', check:\n  1. Database name is correct (case-sensitive)\n  2. Username exists in the database\n  3. Password is correct\n  4. User is active and not blocked\n\n**Response Format:**\n```json\n{\n    \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n    \"result\": 2,  // UID as integer, or false if authentication fails\n    \"id\": 1\n}\n```\n\n**Example:** If authentication is successful and the user ID is 2, the result will be the number `2`, not `{\"uid\": 2}`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Read - Blog Entries",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log('Found', jsonData.result.length, 'blog entries');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n    \"method\": \"call\",\n    \"params\": {\n        \"service\": \"object\",\n        \"method\": \"execute_kw\",\n        \"args\": [\n            \"{{odoo_database}}\",\n            {{odoo_uid}},\n            \"{{odoo_password}}\",\n            \"blog.entry\",  // Model name\n            \"search_read\",  // Method\n            [[[]]],  // Domain (empty = all records)\n            {\n                \"fields\": [\"title\", \"slug\", \"author_id\", \"create_date\"],\n                \"limit\": 10,\n                \"offset\": 0,\n                \"order\": \"create_date desc\"\n            }\n        ]\n    },\n    \"id\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{odoo_base_url}}/jsonrpc",
              "host": [
                "{{odoo_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "jsonrpc"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Search and read blog entries using JSON RPC. This demonstrates the standard Odoo ORM search_read method."
          },
          "response": []
        },
